  "definition": "Physical Science Teacher For Grades 7-12",
  "effectiveDate": "2018-01-12",
  "historyNote": "#10506, eff 1-17-14; ss by #12459, eff 1-12-18; renumbered by #12603 (formerly Ed 507.51)",
